The Next AI Breakthrough Isn't a Model. It's All-Source Data Fusion
  URL: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/next-ai-breakthrough-isnt-model-its-all-source-data-fusion-palifka-gffwe
  Every company has more data than ever. Almost none of it actually works together. That's the real bottleneck in enterprise AI.

